Rembric OpenCode V2 plugin
==========================

core/rembric-plugin-core.mjs and core/rembric-dotenv.mjs are vendored
unmodified from the Rembric project:

  https://github.com/susomejias/rembric
  apps/plugin/bin/rembric-plugin-core.mjs
  apps/plugin/mcp-bridge/rembric-dotenv.mjs

Rembric is MIT licensed. Copyright its authors. The vendored files carry no
local modifications; the V2 adapter in index.ts is independently written
against OpenCode's documented V2 plugin API.

The default export is a plain `{ id, setup }` object, so the built bundle
inlines both vendored files and has no runtime dependencies.
